# What the .vsix carries: `out/` (compiled), `prompts/` (read at run time) and `media/` (icon, panel).
# Those three must stay. Everything below is source, repository documentation or tooling.
#
# `node_modules` is deliberately not listed: vsce excludes development dependencies by itself, and if this
# extension ever gains a runtime dependency, that dependency has to ship.
.vscode/**
.github/**
src/**
docs/**
**/*.map
tsconfig.json
package-lock.json
.gitignore
.editorconfig
.vscodeignore
